      "side": 1,
      "message": "Could we keep ubuntu@26.04 as the default on main? With SUNBEAM_TEST_BASE unset, the documented local tox command renders Keystone with ubuntu@24.04 while still requesting 2026.2/edge. I reproduced this against the parent and confirmed that the channel\u0027s amd64 revision supports only ubuntu@26.04. Juju bundle deployment validates the explicitly requested base. The Ansible role has the same Noble fallback when func_charm_base is unset, and Octavia\u0027s Port CNI lookup uses the same 2026.2/edge channel. Please keep the defaults aligned with each branch\u0027s channels and retain the override.",
      "revId": "232c06a9ba00d24e1e7b9be7fcbbc8291148bb2e",
