      "side": 1,
      "message": "Could we put the temporary output directory inside the charm directory and pass its absolute path to Charmcraft? mktemp -d uses TMPDIR or /tmp, which can be on a separate mount from the checkout. Charmcraft 4.5 finalizes managed packs by moving the artifact from the project directory to --output with Path.rename(). I exercised that code with a staged artifact and got EXDEV across mounts. A checkout on ext4 with /tmp on tmpfs hits this after the pack has finished.",
      "revId": "232c06a9ba00d24e1e7b9be7fcbbc8291148bb2e",
